sentences.text:
The petitioner has approached this Court to quash the said criminal proceeding on the following grounds:-
(a) The FIR was filed at a very belated stage for non- payment of dues in the year 2016 to 2018;
(b) Insolvency and Bankruptcy proceeding has already been initiated against the petitioner;
(c) The petitioners actually paid entire dues by issuing Bank drafts against the receipt issued by the opposite party no. 2 long before the filing of the FIR.
